1
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,632
[Aoba Dormitory]

2
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:17,350
Man, starting today,
I'm rooming with a newbie.

3
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:18,384
What a drag.

4
00:00:18,384 --> 00:00:22,620
Seriously. We have to teach him
everything from scratch.

5
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:26,180
But you're happy about it, right, Sui?

6
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:28,020
Yeah. I'm super excited.

7
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:30,520
Hope a cute one walks in.

8
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:34,790
No, there's no way
the newbie would want that.

9
00:00:34,790 --> 00:00:37,490
Hey, no jumping them in their sleep, okay?

10
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:40,240
I wouldn't do that.

11
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:42,510
I'm heading out then.

12
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:43,770
Okay.

13
00:00:46,174 --> 00:00:48,974
That guy's always giving a goofy smile.

14
00:00:48,974 --> 00:00:51,034
Your voice is too loud.

15
00:00:51,034 --> 00:00:52,704
Sorry.

16
00:00:53,344 --> 00:00:55,869
[Sofu High School 2025 Entrance Ceremony]

17
00:00:55,869 --> 00:00:59,534
Congratulations on your enrollment.

18
00:01:00,474 --> 00:01:07,814
Before each of you now
lies a rich path filled with encounters.

19
00:01:43,984 --> 00:01:47,344
Nice to meet you. I'm Harutora Kurobe.

20
00:01:47,344 --> 00:01:51,084
My hobby is basketball. Nice to meet you.

21
00:01:56,914 --> 00:01:58,964
W-Well...

22
00:02:01,036 --> 00:02:02,784
Thank you. That's so kind.

23
00:02:02,784 --> 00:02:06,074
Sui Kishida, second-year student.
Nice to meet you.

24
00:02:06,074 --> 00:02:07,374
Thank you.

25
00:02:13,924 --> 00:02:15,464
No need to be so nervous.

26
00:02:15,464 --> 00:02:17,407
It was a long way here, right?

27
00:02:17,407 --> 00:02:20,054
Make yourself at home.

28
00:02:23,184 --> 00:02:25,644
So, what should I call you?

29
00:02:27,654 --> 00:02:30,044
- Well...
- Your name.

30
00:02:33,110 --> 00:02:35,524
My first name is fine.

31
00:02:35,524 --> 00:02:37,034
Harutora, huh?

32
00:02:37,034 --> 00:02:39,574
Okay, Harutora then.

33
00:02:39,574 --> 00:02:42,564
You can call me Sui.

34
00:02:44,814 --> 00:02:48,183
But you're older than me.

35
00:02:48,183 --> 00:02:49,724
Oh, right.

36
00:03:41,384 --> 00:03:44,847
[Sofu High School]

37
00:03:48,514 --> 00:03:50,314
Focus!

38
00:03:51,414 --> 00:03:53,214
Stay focused!

39
00:04:03,544 --> 00:04:04,554
No way.

40
00:04:04,554 --> 00:04:06,954
He's like a real-life Hanamichi.

41
00:04:16,924 --> 00:04:18,344
Welcome back.

42
00:04:18,344 --> 00:04:21,014
Oh, wow.

43
00:04:21,014 --> 00:04:22,644
I got a little heated up.

44
00:04:22,644 --> 00:04:24,344
Oh, I see.

45
00:04:40,201 --> 00:04:42,964
- I'll do it.
- N-No, it's fine.

46
00:04:42,964 --> 00:04:46,744
I'm free anyway. I'll clean this area too.

47
00:04:51,404 --> 00:04:55,024
Sui, want to hit the bath together?

48
00:04:55,024 --> 00:04:56,508
Huh?

49
00:04:56,508 --> 00:04:59,944
I'll wash your back
as thanks for cleaning up.

50
00:04:59,944 --> 00:05:02,934
You don't have to.
I always just take a shower anyway.

51
00:05:02,934 --> 00:05:04,024
Really?

52
00:05:04,024 --> 00:05:05,364
Yeah.

53
00:05:06,214 --> 00:05:09,214
The big bath feels amazing, though.

54
00:05:09,214 --> 00:05:10,544
I'm sure.

55
00:05:10,544 --> 00:05:13,714
Honestly, I'd love to go in too.

56
00:05:33,494 --> 00:05:35,084
Practicing?

57
00:05:38,844 --> 00:05:41,264
Did I wake you? Sorry.

58
00:05:41,264 --> 00:05:44,694
It's fine.
I'm impressed you do this every day.

59
00:05:50,994 --> 00:05:53,074
You're mistaken.

60
00:05:53,074 --> 00:05:55,424
It's the opposite.

61
00:05:56,444 --> 00:05:57,664
Huh?

62
00:06:02,484 --> 00:06:05,074
Go for it, Harutora!

63
00:06:08,924 --> 00:06:12,524
Hey, is this really all you need?

64
00:06:12,524 --> 00:06:14,264
You asked for my help.

65
00:06:14,264 --> 00:06:17,474
Yeah. It really motivates me.

66
00:06:18,274 --> 00:06:22,374
Ever since I started high school,
everyone's so talented.

67
00:06:22,374 --> 00:06:25,874
I realized I thought of myself too highly.

68
00:06:25,874 --> 00:06:28,864
It's really embarrassing.

69
00:06:28,864 --> 00:06:31,264
So, thank you.

70
00:06:32,024 --> 00:06:33,674
Really?

71
00:06:33,674 --> 00:06:37,944
Okay, then. Do your best, Harutora!

72
00:06:37,944 --> 00:06:43,174
You're Japan's top player. A champion.
Guaranteed starter.

73
00:06:43,174 --> 00:06:48,464
You're cool, tall, and have killer abs.

74
00:06:48,464 --> 00:06:51,614
Sui, that's a bit much...

75
00:06:57,694 --> 00:07:01,784
Wow! That's amazing! Seriously?

76
00:07:06,574 --> 00:07:08,113
Sui?

77
00:07:08,886 --> 00:07:12,164
I thought it'd be weird if I went overboard.

78
00:07:12,164 --> 00:07:14,554
It's not weird at all.

79
00:07:14,554 --> 00:07:16,544
O-Oh, okay.

80
00:07:17,864 --> 00:07:21,804
But isn't it hot with that mask on?

81
00:07:21,804 --> 00:07:23,134
Huh?

82
00:07:23,134 --> 00:07:25,027
You should take it off.

83
00:07:27,334 --> 00:07:32,784
It's second nature now,
so I'm too embarrassed to take it off.

84
00:07:32,784 --> 00:07:35,324
- Embarrassed?
- Yeah.

85
00:07:35,324 --> 00:07:37,184
Why's that?

86
00:07:42,414 --> 00:07:45,114
Sorry. Never mind.

87
00:07:45,114 --> 00:07:48,254
No, it's not that I don't want to tell you.

88
00:07:48,254 --> 00:07:55,664
You know when you have to smile,
but you don't really want to?

89
00:07:58,458 --> 00:08:01,504
Right. That's not normal, huh?

90
00:08:01,504 --> 00:08:03,318
But I get that a lot.

91
00:08:04,244 --> 00:08:08,834
I realized my mask
makes me look like I'm smiling.

92
00:08:08,834 --> 00:08:10,894
So I keep it on.

93
00:08:10,894 --> 00:08:15,619
You do have that crinkle around your eyes.

94
00:08:16,384 --> 00:08:17,624
Yeah.

95
00:08:18,904 --> 00:08:20,974
I think it's cute.

96
00:08:26,169 --> 00:08:30,244
S-Sorry, I was out of line
for calling you cute.

97
00:08:30,244 --> 00:08:34,064
No, thank you. I'm really happy.

98
00:08:34,064 --> 00:08:37,964
Honestly. I really am.

99
00:08:44,333 --> 00:08:46,254
Sui.

100
00:08:50,024 --> 00:08:54,014
I promise I'll make the bench.

101
00:08:55,044 --> 00:08:58,304
So please come watch my game.

102
00:08:58,304 --> 00:09:00,914
Huh? Can I?

103
00:09:00,914 --> 00:09:02,744
Yes.

104
00:09:02,744 --> 00:09:06,384
Really? I'll go! I'll go for sure!

105
00:09:10,714 --> 00:09:13,864
Whoa, that's amazing!

106
00:09:13,864 --> 00:09:19,104
56... 57...

107
00:09:19,104 --> 00:09:25,434
58... 59... 60...

108
00:09:36,124 --> 00:09:37,454
Wow!

109
00:09:39,604 --> 00:09:42,814
Ready? Go!

110
00:09:44,074 --> 00:09:47,514
So fast... That's incredible.

111
00:09:52,004 --> 00:09:56,374
The results come out tomorrow, so...

112
00:09:57,384 --> 00:09:58,865
I see.

113
00:09:59,661 --> 00:10:02,964
Hope you get a uniform.

114
00:10:04,534 --> 00:10:05,924
Yeah!

115
00:10:12,384 --> 00:10:14,734
Welcome!

116
00:10:14,734 --> 00:10:19,234
It's cheap. We've got a special sale today.

117
00:10:19,234 --> 00:10:22,974
Cheap strawberries, lemons, and bananas!

118
00:10:22,974 --> 00:10:26,574
Welcome! Everything's cheap!

119
00:10:26,574 --> 00:10:31,104
Cheap bananas, melons, and strawberries!

120
00:10:31,104 --> 00:10:35,494
Special sale on lemons today! I recommend it!

121
00:11:04,685 --> 00:11:06,094
That's sweet!

122
00:11:14,633 --> 00:11:16,634
Did you make that?

123
00:11:16,634 --> 00:11:18,014
For your girlfriend?

124
00:11:18,014 --> 00:11:20,204
No, idiot.

125
00:11:20,204 --> 00:11:21,724
Okay, then.

126
00:11:23,014 --> 00:11:26,484
Not everyone's into girls, you know.

127
00:11:26,484 --> 00:11:29,294
Wait, so that means...

128
00:11:42,286 --> 00:11:46,399
[Sorry.]

129
00:12:12,284 --> 00:12:13,966
Harutora?

130
00:12:14,784 --> 00:12:16,444
Are you going?

131
00:12:16,444 --> 00:12:17,924
Yeah.

132
00:12:19,504 --> 00:12:22,224
Do your best. I'm rooting for you.

133
00:12:28,484 --> 00:12:30,644
Sui.

134
00:12:30,644 --> 00:12:31,924
Yeah?

135
00:12:33,234 --> 00:12:34,684
I...

136
00:12:35,754 --> 00:12:39,134
I didn't get a uniform.

137
00:12:42,375 --> 00:12:46,334
I'm sorry. Even after all your support...

138
00:12:48,834 --> 00:12:51,774
W-Wait.

139
00:12:51,774 --> 00:12:53,644
Y-You see...

140
00:12:56,974 --> 00:12:58,624
H-Here.

141
00:13:00,144 --> 00:13:02,374
Take this, if you want.

142
00:13:02,374 --> 00:13:05,224
Even if you're not playing.

143
00:13:05,224 --> 00:13:07,564
It's good for you, so have some.

144
00:13:21,604 --> 00:13:28,214
Actually, I saw it in the fridge yesterday.

145
00:13:29,554 --> 00:13:32,494
I was hoping it was for me.

146
00:13:33,608 --> 00:13:35,958
So I'm really happy.

147
00:13:38,536 --> 00:13:41,274
See you, Sui.

148
00:13:42,384 --> 00:13:43,864
Harutora...

149
00:14:18,924 --> 00:14:22,494
Did they win?

150
00:14:27,254 --> 00:14:29,295
Did they lose?

151
00:14:29,295 --> 00:14:32,414
Wait, what am I thinking?

152
00:14:32,414 --> 00:14:36,444
Did they win? Did they lose?

153
00:14:36,444 --> 00:14:39,504
Sui, I'm back.

154
00:14:39,504 --> 00:14:42,815
W-Welcome back, Harutora.

155
00:14:42,815 --> 00:14:44,904
How'd the game go?

156
00:14:50,504 --> 00:14:53,394
I lost my voice.

157
00:14:58,212 --> 00:14:59,884
From cheering?

158
00:15:00,894 --> 00:15:02,704
Yes.

159
00:15:04,764 --> 00:15:06,694
I see.

160
00:15:07,444 --> 00:15:09,224
We won.

161
00:15:09,974 --> 00:15:13,164
C-Congratulations.

162
00:15:13,164 --> 00:15:15,154
It was delicious.

163
00:15:16,124 --> 00:15:20,924
The honey lemon you made, Sui.

164
00:15:22,054 --> 00:15:24,714
I ate it all by myself.

165
00:15:25,504 --> 00:15:28,944
All of it, on your own?

166
00:15:29,744 --> 00:15:30,994
Yes.

167
00:15:38,974 --> 00:15:42,204
Oh? Sui's making a move on the newbie.

168
00:15:42,204 --> 00:15:47,564
Dai-chan. N-No, I just stumbled.

169
00:15:47,564 --> 00:15:48,624
Oh, really?

170
00:15:48,624 --> 00:15:51,684
Better watch out, junior.

171
00:15:52,354 --> 00:15:54,164
You didn't know?

172
00:15:54,164 --> 00:15:56,554
This guy's gay.

173
00:15:58,394 --> 00:16:00,874
Hey, you're making things awkward.

174
00:16:00,874 --> 00:16:01,994
Why?

175
00:16:01,994 --> 00:16:04,414
Tact, man.

176
00:16:12,454 --> 00:16:16,074
Sorry, Harutora.
Bet that surprised you, huh?

177
00:16:16,074 --> 00:16:17,904
B-But don't worry.

178
00:16:17,904 --> 00:16:20,684
I'm into flashy party types.

179
00:16:20,684 --> 00:16:24,924
Serious guys like you aren't my type at all.

180
00:16:26,774 --> 00:16:29,154
That's literally me.

181
00:16:29,154 --> 00:16:31,274
What part of you screams "party"?

182
00:16:31,274 --> 00:16:33,874
Everywhere, obviously.

183
00:16:33,874 --> 00:16:35,014
I'm a party guy.

184
00:16:35,014 --> 00:16:36,184
- Definitely.
- I guess so.

185
00:16:36,184 --> 00:16:38,474
- Well...
- So that's totally me, right?

186
00:17:05,094 --> 00:17:08,224
Sui, what are you looking at?

187
00:17:08,224 --> 00:17:10,064
W-Well...
[My Heart - Matching]

188
00:17:11,564 --> 00:17:12,934
Wait.

189
00:17:14,174 --> 00:17:17,784
Does this mean you're into guys?

190
00:17:42,024 --> 00:17:46,482
[Sorry.]

191
00:18:03,734 --> 00:18:05,116
Stand.

192
00:18:09,284 --> 00:18:10,874
Bow.

193
00:18:10,874 --> 00:18:13,604
- Goodbye.
- Goodbye.

194
00:18:13,604 --> 00:18:16,607
- Let's go karaoke.
- Yeah.

195
00:18:33,826 --> 00:18:34,940
You're into guys?

196
00:18:34,940 --> 00:18:38,005
[Sorry.]
<i>This guy's gay.</i>

197
00:18:54,624 --> 00:18:56,314
Welcome back.

198
00:18:57,914 --> 00:18:59,494
What is this?

199
00:18:59,494 --> 00:19:02,994
You like the party type, right?

200
00:19:05,204 --> 00:19:09,505
That means people who like to party, right?

201
00:19:11,240 --> 00:19:12,904
Y-Yeah.

202
00:19:13,924 --> 00:19:18,334
I made this at a friend's room yesterday.

203
00:19:18,334 --> 00:19:19,604
Huh?

204
00:19:29,644 --> 00:19:31,064
I mean...

205
00:19:32,604 --> 00:19:35,674
I kept putting you on edge.

206
00:19:35,674 --> 00:19:37,474
I'm sorry!

207
00:19:38,774 --> 00:19:40,152
What?

208
00:19:43,714 --> 00:19:47,734
<i>You're always smiling,</i>

209
00:19:47,734 --> 00:19:54,574
<i>so I thought you were actually into me.</i>

210
00:19:56,194 --> 00:19:59,624
But I was wrong.

211
00:20:01,874 --> 00:20:07,294
So I thought I'd at least try
to become the type you like.

212
00:20:09,094 --> 00:20:13,634
I may not be good enough, but...

213
00:20:13,634 --> 00:20:20,034
I'll do my very best
so that you can find a place of peace

214
00:20:20,034 --> 00:20:22,854
while being by my side.

215
00:20:25,274 --> 00:20:30,114
So, please, I hope we can keep getting along!

216
00:20:34,514 --> 00:20:37,124
N-No, you're mistaken, Harutora!

217
00:20:37,854 --> 00:20:40,614
Th-That's not what happened.

218
00:20:43,124 --> 00:20:44,704
You see...

219
00:20:46,214 --> 00:20:52,464
I thought you'd feel more comfortable
if you thought you weren't my type.

220
00:20:52,464 --> 00:20:57,174
That's why I lied
about liking the party type.

221
00:21:01,814 --> 00:21:04,054
And this mask, too.

222
00:21:05,804 --> 00:21:09,144
When it got out that I was gay...

223
00:21:11,554 --> 00:21:13,994
it was hard to smile.

224
00:21:16,024 --> 00:21:17,644
So that's why...

225
00:21:29,516 --> 00:21:31,076
But still...

226
00:21:33,074 --> 00:21:37,174
When I'm with you, I smile for real.

227
00:21:37,174 --> 00:21:39,164
That's the truth.

228
00:21:42,674 --> 00:21:44,534
Sui...

229
00:21:44,534 --> 00:21:49,104
Then can you take your mask off
when it's just us?

230
00:21:49,104 --> 00:21:50,744
Huh?

231
00:21:50,744 --> 00:21:55,814
When you're wearing it,
I can't tell if you're feeling down.

232
00:21:56,935 --> 00:21:58,560
Is that weird?

233
00:21:58,560 --> 00:22:00,364
It's not weird, but...

234
00:22:00,364 --> 00:22:02,564
Is that a no?

235
00:22:02,564 --> 00:22:05,294
I wouldn't say no, but...

236
00:22:05,294 --> 00:22:08,644
Please, Sui.

237
00:22:12,539 --> 00:22:15,694
B-But it's embarrassing.

238
00:22:20,345 --> 00:22:22,141
Sorry.

239
00:22:24,476 --> 00:22:27,586
The way you get embarrassed, Sui...

240
00:22:29,234 --> 00:22:31,234
I think I'm into it.

241
00:22:33,694 --> 00:22:35,074
Huh?

242
00:23:45,494 --> 00:23:48,324
Harutora's his usual self.

243
00:23:48,324 --> 00:23:50,194
I'm actually... lucky.

244
00:23:50,194 --> 00:23:52,374
I've never really understood my own feelings.

245
00:23:52,374 --> 00:23:55,594
A smile doesn't always mean someone likes it.

246
00:23:55,594 --> 00:23:56,904
Then...

247
00:23:56,904 --> 00:24:00,144
Sui, this is what you want, right?

